            }
        ],
        "type": null
    },
    {
        "role": "bullet",
        "segment": "Class size (sum of the total number of operations and the number of attributes, counting inherited features as well as features defined in the class) is another OO size measure that helps evaluate high-level design and the likely effort needed.",
