    "segment": "The system design provides a complete description of the functions and interactions involved, which then guides the creation and integration of the programs.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "source_text",
        "content": "The basis for our discussion is a well-defined description of the software project as a system; the system design includes a complete description of the functions and interactions involved.",
        "img_id": null
      }
    ],
    "type": null
  },
  {
